{"after_gate_rev": null, "author_time": 1758734855, "commit": "37db715203ea1021035f02921606ca622ac6ab9a", "id": "squidex-37db715203ea", "issue": {"body": "### Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.\n\nCurrently, the Squidex UI and backend do not have German (`de`) language support. As a German-speaking user, I would like to use the interface in my native language, which would improve the user experience for the German community.\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like\n\nI would like to add full German language support to Squidex. I have already completed the translation for both the frontend and backend JSON files, following the contribution guidelines.\n\nThe following files will be added:\n\n* `backend/i18n/source/frontend_de.json`\n* `backend/i18n/source/backend_de.json`\n\nAdditionally, the necessary configuration files (`languages.state.ts`, `Languages.cs`, `WebExtensions.cs`) will be updated to register the new language and the generated files [`backend/i18n/frontend_de.json`, `backend/src/Squidex.Shared/Texts.de.resx`] from the translator tool will be added.\n\n### Additional context\n\nI am preparing a Pull Request that will include all the necessary changes. This issue is to track the feature request and announce the upcoming PR.", "number": 1255, "title": "[Feature] Add German Language Support (de)"}, "issue_fetch": "ok", "parent": "762f44557091622bb1fd7a20d042dbe9b014c9b9", "pr": null, "probe": {}, "prompt_subject": "Resolve the GitHub issue below.", "repo": "squidex", "shape": "symptom", "stats": {"code_files": 3, "code_lines": 7, "test_files": 0}, "subject": "feat: Add German language support (#1256)", "truth": {"code": [{"hunks": [[143, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "backend/i18n/translator/Squidex.Translator/Commands.cs", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[35, 1]], "old_path": null, "path": "backend/src/Squidex/Config/Web/WebExtensions.cs", "status": "M"}, {"hunks": [[28, 0]], "old_path": null, "path": "frontend/src/app/shared/state/ui-languages.ts", "status": "M"}], "other": ["backend/i18n/frontend_de.json", "backend/i18n/source/backend_de.json", "backend/i18n/source/frontend_de.json", "backend/i18n/translate.sh", "backend/src/Squidex.Shared/Texts.de.resx", "backend/src/Squidex/Squidex.csproj"], "tests": []}}
